<h1>Support Desk reference host</h1>
<p class="notice">Synthetic accounts and tickets. Local demo only. No model provider is called.</p>
<p>Sign in to stream a ticket, save a private draft, continue the conversation, and close the ticket.</p>
<% %w[Alice Bob Reader].each do |name| %>
